              "text": "effigiēs, effigiēī — \"a likeness, effigy\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Effigiēs avī in ātriō stat. A likeness of grandfather stands in the hall."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine, fifth declension, from effingō — to shape, portray. English effigy."
            }
          ]
