              "text": "figūra, figūrae — \"a shape, form, figure\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Pictor figūram equī in mūrō pingit. The painter paints the shape of a horse on the wall."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine, first declension, from fingō. English figure."
            }
          ]
        },
