              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "caelō, caelāre — \"to engrave, carve in relief\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Faber pōculum argenteum caelat. The smith engraves a silver cup."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "caelō, caelāre, caelāvī, caelātum: raised work on silver, gold or ivory. Not to be confused with cēlō — to hide."
            }
          ]
        },
